        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“Somewhere in the abandoned subway, gold is hidden.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stepped into the sealed underground, guided by nothing but that rumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this place wasn’t just ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/2267804297269425806aa8ebfca4a530.poster.avif?t=1755198302\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/2267804297269425806aa8ebfca4a530.webm?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/2267804297269425806aa8ebfca4a530.mp4?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/8d9ac598fee939cd59bf29c47b3ad742.poster.avif?t=1755198302\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/8d9ac598fee939cd59bf29c47b3ad742.webm?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/8d9ac598fee939cd59bf29c47b3ad742.mp4?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is after you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something that follows you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It moves through the darkness and never gives up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet. Move carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/3866fc8a93052abd9a7cf1330268eab8.poster.avif?t=1755198302\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/3866fc8a93052abd9a7cf1330268eab8.webm?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/3866fc8a93052abd9a7cf1330268eab8.mp4?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/bf2d050f7a416981bf72d9eeb87a4eed.poster.avif?t=1755198302\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/bf2d050f7a416981bf72d9eeb87a4eed.webm?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/bf2d050f7a416981bf72d9eeb87a4eed.mp4?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes, you must fight back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the means to resist.<br>Running alone may not always be enough.<br>Opportunities are rare—but not impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/cbe13a7e7779af0707b187d2f4d72c1f.poster.avif?t=1755198302\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/cbe13a7e7779af0707b187d2f4d72c1f.webm?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876470/extras/cbe13a7e7779af0707b187d2f4d72c1f.mp4?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Line</strong> is a tense first-person survival horror game set in an abandoned underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: collect gold, find key items, and escape — but you're not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet. Sound attracts what's hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, hide, and survive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Survival Horror</strong><br>Face unbearable tension in a claustrophobic, underground environment.<br>This is a single-player only experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear Objectives</strong><br>Collect gold and uncover escape routes by managing your resources wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Escape Routes</strong><br>Choose from several exit strategies — each with unique requirements and obstacles.<br>Your decisions shape your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Pursuer</strong><br>An AI-controlled monster reacts dynamically to sound and movement.<br>Stay alert. One slip-up can be fatal.</p>",
