apps/3876470/extras/cbe13a7e7779af0707b187d2f4d72c1f.mp4?t=1755198302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Line</strong> is a tense first-person survival horror game set in an abandoned underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: collect gold, find key items, and escape — but you're not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet. Sound attracts what's hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run, hide, and survive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Survival Horror</strong><br>Face unbearable tension in a claustrophobic, underground environment.<br>This is a single-player only experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear Objectives</strong><br>Collect gold and uncover escape routes by managing your resources wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Escape Routes</strong><br>Choose from several exit strategies — each with unique requirements and obstacles.<br>Your decisions shape your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Pursuer</strong><br>An AI-controlled monster reacts dynamically to sound and movement.<br>Stay alert. One slip-up can be fatal.</p>",
